※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4280 LANG_TABLE_VALUES_NOT_COMPARABLE

※ Two dictionaries are equal where each key stands for an equal value in both, so
※ comparing them compares their values -- and a record has no `=` yet.

type Point = x : u8 ; y : u8

fn alike(a: ⸨u8: Point⸩, b: ⸨u8: Point⸩) → bool:
    a = b

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    0u6
